BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Open OnDemand in the Classroom Affinity Group BoF - Karen Tomk
 o [Ohio Supercomputer Center]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T170000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T183000
DTSTAMP:20261020T211525Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-3TXSS3@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:This Birds-of-a-Feather (BoF) session is for GOOD attendees in
 terested in Open OnDemand (OOD) for instructional use. With rising demand 
 for centralized computing in education\, OOD’s web interface helps instr
 uctors and students access high-end resources easily. The BoF will feature
  presentations on OOD customizations for teaching\, interactive demos\, an
 d Q&A\, fostering community discussion and sharing of adaptable solutions.
  Attendees will connect with peers and learn techniques for classroom and 
 broader OOD use.\n\nInvited Speakers: \n - Martin Cuma [University of Utah
 ]\n - Sean Anderson [Wake Forest University]
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/3TXSS3/
END:VEVENT
